{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45646","headline":"行路难 五 · 贯休","name":"行路难 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君不见道傍树有寄生枝，青青郁郁同荣衰。\n无情之物尚如此，爲人不及还堪悲。\n父归坟兮未朝夕，已分黄金争田宅。\n高堂老母头似霜，心作数支泪常滴。\n我闻忽如负芒刺，不独爲君空叹息。\n古人尺布犹可缝，浔阳义犬令人忆。\n寄言世上爲人子，孝义团圆莫如此。\n若如此，不遄死兮更何俟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45646.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45646","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}